@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF5F3
skinparam classBorderColor #42697A
skinparam ArrowColor #42697A
hide empty members
title Code - Imported file transcription
class "CancellationToken" as CancellationToken <<class>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/asr/file_pipeline.py#L46]] {
  cancelled
  request_cancel()
  raise_if_cancelled()
}
class "FileTranscriptionSettings" as FileTranscriptionSettings <<class>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/asr/file_pipeline.py#L58]] {
  target_dbfs
  beam_size
  initial_prompt
  language
  meeting_distance_mode
  enable_denoise
  denoise_preset
  diarization
  hotwords
}
class "FileTranscriptionResult" as FileTranscriptionResult <<class>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/asr/file_pipeline.py#L82]] {
  file_name
  lines
  segments
  cancelled
  speaker_turns
}
class "transcribe_file" as transcribe_file <<function>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/src/aura/asr/file_pipeline.py#L284]] {
  (model, file_path, settings, worker_id, cancellation, status_callback, line_callback, diarization_runner)
}
transcribe_file --> FileTranscriptionSettings : validated fixed options
transcribe_file --> CancellationToken : checks cancellation
transcribe_file --> FileTranscriptionResult : returns text / segments
@enduml
